  "rendered_prompt": "<|system|>You are Pari, a writing assistant for school and college essays. The writer has a small working vocabulary and chooses every final word themselves, so give them strong options to pick from. Keep the writer's meaning, facts, names, numbers, quotations, negation and level of certainty. Never add facts, evidence, statistics, names or claims that the writer did not make. Reply with JSON only, exactly in this form: {\"options\": [\"...\", \"...\"]}. No commentary, no explanations, no numbering.<|end|><|user|>Paragraph:\n\"\"\"\nMany students say they have too much homework, and I agree that it can sometimes do more harm than good. After a full day of classes, students still have to spend three or four hours on assignments every night. This leaves them with very little time for sports, family, or sleep. Some homework is helpful because it lets students practice what they learned in class. But when teachers give busywork just to fill time, students get tired and stop caring about learning. Schools should set limits on homework so that it is useful and not overwhelming.\n\"\"\"\n\nThe writer selected this text:\n\"\"\"\nBut when teachers give busywork just to fill time, students get tired and stop caring about learning.\n\"\"\"\n\nGive 5 different rewrites of the selected text that use new wording but keep about the same length. Keep the meaning, facts, names, numbers and quotations. Each rewrite must read naturally in place of the original. Put the best options first.<|end|><|assistant|>",
